{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"Alexandroff拓扑"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"Alexandroff 拓扑"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>偏序集上的 Alexandroff 拓扑是以其向上封闭子集为开集的拓扑.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>与有限空间的关系</h3>\n<p>每个 $T_0$ 有限拓扑空间都是某个偏序集的 Alexandroff 拓扑.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"Sierpiński空间","text":"Sierpiński 空间"}},{"Plain":" (作为拓扑空间) 是"},{"Local":{"url":"真值","text":"真值"}},{"Plain":"的偏序集上的 Alexandroff 拓扑.</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}